            "displayName": "Otis Gospodnetic",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Could one argue that maybe your queryParser/tokenizer shouldn't create null queries and add them to BooleanQuery clauses?\n\nYour patch uses different spacing (should be 2) .\n\nAlso, check this:\n\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/jwang/projects/lucene_2_3_1/src/java/org/apache/lucene/search/BooleanQuery.java\t(revision 641933)\n+++ /Users/jwang/projects/lucene_2_3_1/src/java/org/apache/lucene/search/BooleanQuery.java\t(working copy)\n\n\nNote the full path to the modified file.  You should make a diff with \"svn diff src/java/.....\" instead.\n\nThanks.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=otis",
            "name": "otis",
            "key": "otis",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859"
            },
            "displayName": "Otis Gospodnetic",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2008-05-17T02:24:45.375+0000",
          "updated": "2008-05-17T02:26:43.377+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12392478/comment/12646400",
          "id": "12646400",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markrmiller%40gmail.com",
            "name": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
            "key": "markrmiller@gmail.com",
